                                        "entry_id": "c8d1a4a7-9a48-3b80-be0e-7f66118c2bd0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An official report or statement, such as a government press release or the report of a conference."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "92d6a706-1fd0-411c-8aa7-0e98b171fbba",
                                                "sense_id": "c2260a9e-5bf4-3836-b95b-7956cb92f377",
                                                "text": "Otherwise, during the early decades of the Security Council there were few instances when private meetings were held and only a communiqué was issued."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dcf2f611-8608-4937-8bfc-b3386eca3dd4",
                                                "sense_id": "c2260a9e-5bf4-3836-b95b-7956cb92f377",
                                                "text": "Another fate the Europeans couldn't contemplate was not having a final communiqué at all, because if there was no final statement, maybe the meeting never took place, and how terrible that would be for mankind."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
